{"id":"praktisch","lemma":"praktisch","pos":"adj","rank":1627,"glosses":["practical","applied","convenient"],"ipa":"/ˈpʁaktɪʃ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/97/De-praktisch.ogg/De-praktisch.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"praktischer","superlative":"am praktischsten"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich kenne Sie praktisch nicht.","en":"I hardly even know you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756409","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"kennen"},{"g":"she / they / you"},null,{"g":"not"}]},{"text":"Das ist sehr praktisch.","en":"That's very handy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/392522","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Auf diese Weise ist es viel praktischer.","en":"It's much more practical this way.","words":[{"g":"on"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"way, manner"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"much, a lot"},null]},{"text":"Er ist praktisch schon tot.","en":"He is practically dead.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"already"},{"g":"dead, deceased"}]},{"text":"Es war praktisch.","en":"It was convenient.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null]}]}